<title>USA: MFB completes stock buybacks.</title>
<headline>MFB completes stock buybacks.</headline>
<dateline>MISHAWAKA, Ind. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MFB Corp, parent of Mishawaka Federal Savings, said on Thursday it completed its previously announced share repurchases.</p>
<p>A total of 192,763 shares have been repurchased at an average price of $18.68 per share.</p>
<p>The corporation had announced authorization of a share repurchase program on July 11, 1996 allowing the repurchase of up to 98,699 of the outstanding shares. On October 8, MFB authorized the buyback of an additional 93,764 shares.</p>
<p>MFB's shares closed on Thursday at 17-1/2.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
